Green!

21
00:02:11.202 --> 00:02:16.744
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:16.794 --> 00:02:17.944
Bright!

23
00:02:18.752 --> 00:02:26.696
Think and answer. What color and shape do you like best?

24
